Aim: Demonstrate commonly used String methods.

Algorithm: Start
create String
call length, charAt, substring, toUpperCase, equals
print
stop.

Program:

class StringDemo {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        String s = "Java Programming";
        System.out.println("Length: " + s.length());
        System.out.println("Character: " + s.charAt(0));
        System.out.println("Substring: " + s.substring(5));
        System.out.println("Upper: " + s.toUpperCase());
        System.out.println("Replace: " + s.replace("Java", "Python"));
        System.out.println("Equals: " + s.equals("Java Programming"));
    }
}

Result: String length, character, substring, uppercase, replacement and equality are displayed.

